WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.230 --> 00:00:01.590
- I heard that Hilary Duff,

00:00:01.590 --> 00:00:04.200
did she host like, an
entertainment play date?

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:05.530
Like, what happened with your kids?

00:00:05.530 --> 00:00:06.600
What happened?

00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:09.020
- Well Hilary is a close friend

00:00:09.020 --> 00:00:12.620
and she has a daughter who is
six weeks younger than Gus.

00:00:12.620 --> 00:00:13.970
And she's like supermom.

00:00:13.970 --> 00:00:15.060
She has three kids

00:00:15.060 --> 00:00:17.500
but she decided to start
hosting this music class

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:18.340
at her house.

00:00:18.340 --> 00:00:21.610
And there's lots of other
new moms in our group,

00:00:21.610 --> 00:00:23.830
Megan Trainer and Ashley Tisdale.

00:00:23.830 --> 00:00:25.660
So it kind of became
like, a bit of a thing

00:00:25.660 --> 00:00:27.720
but there's lots of other
people that have lots

00:00:27.720 --> 00:00:30.380
of other jobs in this
class, but it's so much fun.

00:00:30.380 --> 00:00:33.710
Like I think in this time
of COVID and, you know,

00:00:33.710 --> 00:00:35.460
having a kid in the midst of a pandemic

00:00:35.460 --> 00:00:38.228
like, finding community to lean on

00:00:38.228 --> 00:00:40.490
and be able to like, have your kids sort

00:00:40.490 --> 00:00:42.620
of start to grow up
together, but also like....

00:00:42.620 --> 00:00:44.170
- And have those pods
where your kids can play

00:00:44.170 --> 00:00:45.003
with other kids.

00:00:45.003 --> 00:00:46.219
- For sure, it's so essential.

00:00:46.219 --> 00:00:48.820
So I'm really grateful
that Hilary has done us all

00:00:48.820 --> 00:00:50.350
this giant favor.

00:00:50.350 --> 00:00:51.183
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:00:51.183 --> 00:00:52.016
- Yeah.

00:00:52.016 --> 00:00:54.110
- 'Cause it's a lot to host
something like that, yeah.

00:00:54.110 --> 00:00:54.943
- Clean up your home.

00:00:54.943 --> 00:00:56.280
- Especially a mom of three.

00:00:56.280 --> 00:00:57.500
Get it Hilary Duff.

00:00:57.500 --> 00:00:58.503
- I know.

00:00:58.503 --> 00:00:59.643
- [Drew] She tryin' to
make us look bad, Mandy.

00:01:00.530 --> 00:01:02.087
- She does it all, for sure.

